    <h2>The middle of the job matters more than the photo at the end</h2>
    <p class="lead">Anyone can photograph a finished kitchen. What tells you whether to trust a builder is what the site looked like in week six — so each project here shows the process, not just the reveal.</p>
    <div class="projects">
      <figure class="project">
