      </figure>
      <figure class="project">
        <img src="/Images/demos/fw-plans.webp" alt="Builder walking homeowners through plans inside the frame" width="900" height="678" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption><h3>What every job includes</h3><p><strong>Process.</strong> A walk-through at framing stage, on every project — it's the last cheap moment to move a wall, a window or a powerpoint, and clients always change something.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
